				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2020 23:15:35 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Parkerson</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6454731</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Upon reading most of the text I seemed to believe that it was funny (see edit history) I apparently even went out of my way to comment such a lousy, no good comment saying how good your joke SCP is. Serious I might not have been all the way through the reading of this page. I seem to have blacked out and I wrote such a despicable reply that I had to edit. But, overall, it's a fantastic SCP concept.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-7210132#post-4325736</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
